      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- Four appliances in this kitchen are leaking energy.\n\n- Take the energy
    scanner from the bench and point it at\nan appliance to read its power draw.
    Yellow status light indicates status is being diagnosed. Red means leak identified.
    \n\n- When a leak is found, pull the insulation lever on the\nwall to apply the
    upgrade. Each appliances status light should turn green. \n\n- Once all appliances
    have been upgraded, watch the power flow indicator beside the fridge speed\nup
    and shine brighter!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
